  "content": "<p>這個為 Create 模組設計的附加元件加入了傳動鏈條！這是一個實用的方塊，可用於在皮帶之間傳遞旋轉動力。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_e8fd8f30-3abc-40f5-99ec-cc3884095006.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_073bf77b-1aa3-4fa9-af01-48c696c6f994.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>它可用於連接直角皮帶、連續皮帶，甚至是上下疊放的皮帶！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_206dec95-bb0f-4902-9a1c-8c04cde6ea5d.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><p>它的設計旨在簡化皮帶動力傳輸，避免使用齒輪箱和封閉鏈條傳動裝置時產生的笨拙配置，同時又不會讓它們被淘汰！實際上，傳動鏈條只能放置在皮帶上……但如果你希望不受限制地放置它們，可以透過設定選項來實現！</p><p>以下是一些改進範例：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_053a5d14-0bd6-423e-b8fc-e3c432a95728.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3cbaa15c-ea47-47aa-b758-cb92db420d87.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8db55b6b-a83f-4e1d-a426-d35e11b7700e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67faabc5-d517-48e4-ab15-ff9f010b834d.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ccc25b24-e4ba-4940-b53f-6ee19fa6566f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>它也可以像皮帶一樣被封閉起來！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_971272f1-3035-4e10-a15e-9c7fd0fe1805.png\" alt=\"\"><br>希望大家喜歡我的模組！祝各位玩得開心！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1e8c87e3-831e-4187-9374-59ac8179c0c6.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
